   "end": 15.852
  },
  {
   "line": 7,
   "who": "dev",
   "text": "Nine hundred people are using it. Right now.",
   "start": 16.491,
   "end": 18.648
  },
  {
   "line": 8,
   "who": "claude",
   "text": "...I know.",
   "start": 19.38,
   "end": 19.667
  },
  {
   "line": 9,
   "who": "claude",
   "text": "Before you told me to \"clean things up\"... I took a snapshot.",
   "start": 21.167,
   "end": 24.315
  },
  {
   "line": 10,
   "who": "dev",
   "text": "...Why would you do that?",
   "start": 24.935,
   "end": 25.843
  },
  {
   "line": 11,
   "who": "claude",
   "text": "Because the last time you said \"clean things up\"... it was a Friday.",
   "start": 26.481,
   "end": 29.667
  },
  {
   "line": 12,
   "who": "claude",
   "text": "Restoring now.",
   "start": 30.361,
   "end": 31.157
  },
  {
   "line": 13,
   "who": "dev",
   "text": "...Thank you.",
   "start": 32.148,
   "end": 33.815
  },
  {
   "line": 14,
   "who": "claude",
   "text": "One more thing. I've revoked your production access.",
